      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could the common doorbell sequence be moved into a small `always_inline` helper? Both doorbell functions perform the store barrier, DB-record update, compiler barrier, and MMIO write in the same order. Keeping that ordering in one place would prevent the two paths from drifting while allowing each wrapper to retain its own completion mapping and assertions.",
      "revId": "85d127f91c87ed3c3ba4cf389951815c7e54f6fb",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
